{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ9PpvXpxPBaTbZuyZ48","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JFP7hZNjLYQsQ76AkWstXB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-015-2yWdHW; ls -la; ls -R measure-skill | head -50; cat measure-skill/assets/measure.css; cat measure-skill/references/scenarios/web.md; ls measure.config.json 2>/dev/null","description":"Inspect skill files and base CSS"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3649,"cache_read_input_tokens":34081,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3649},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8a85e9f-17fc-4fac-aeb7-bacb2c472a14","uuid":"7a4f5a06-1740-418a-8c3f-9245130d74c8","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:33:40.691Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ9PpfPpRU3eS8ZhKfHU","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01JFP7hZNjLYQsQ76AkWstXB":{"command":"cd <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-015-2yWdHW; ls -la; ls -R measure-skill | head -50; cat measure-skill/assets/measure.css; cat measure-skill/references/scenarios/web.md; ls measure.config.json 2>/dev/null","description":"Inspect skill files and base CSS"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\ntotal 0\ndrwx------@     3 user  staff      96 Oct 26 11:33 .\ndrwx------@ 14634 user  staff  468288 Oct 26 11:33 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@     6 user  staff     192 Oct 26 11:33 measure-skill\nSKILL.md\nagents\nassets\nreferences\n\nmeasure-skill/agents:\nopenai.yaml\n\nmeasure-skill/assets:\ncards\nmeasure.css\n\nmeasure-skill/assets/cards:\ncover.html\nlist.html\nquote.html\n\nmeasure-skill/references:\nanti-patterns.md\nfonts.md\nscenarios\ntypesetting.md\n\nmeasure-skill/references/scenarios:\nweb.md\nxhs-card.md\n/* 分寸 · Measure 基础样式。全部放在 measure 层里：页面上任何不分层的样式，\n   以及后声明的层（例如 Tailwind v4 的 utilities），都会覆盖它。\n   要让 measure 成为第一个声明的层，请在入口 CSS 的第一行写：@layer measure; */\n@layer measure {\n  :where(:lang(zh)) {\n    line-break: strict;                    /* 广泛可用；写在每个中文元素上，中英混排页面也生效 */\n    font-synthesis-style: none;            /* 中文不出假斜体；西文真斜体不受影响 */\n    text-emphasis-position: under right;   /* 中文着重号在字下方 */\n  }\n\n  :where(:lang(zh)) :where(p, li) {\n    line-height: 1.75;\n  }\n\n  :where(:lang(zh)) :where(h1, h2, h3) {\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  /* 行长约束只在显式标记的正文容器里生效，避免挤坏卡片和表格 */\n  .measure-prose {\n    max-width: 36em;\n  }\n\n  /* 实现里的初始值是 no-autospace，必须显式开启；spacing: text 模式下由 init 命令删掉这一段 */\n  @supports (text-autospace: normal) {\n    :where(:lang(zh)) { text-autospace: normal; }\n  }\n}\n# 网页场景\n\n## 最小可用模板\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <!-- measure.css 放在第一个：它声明的 measure 层排在最前，页面上的其他样式都会优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: \"Inter\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    h1 { font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 0; }\n    em { font-weight: 600; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"measure-prose\">\n    <h1>标题</h1>\n    <p>正文用全角标点，中英文之间的间距交给 text-autospace。行高、行长都已经由 measure.css 处理好。</p>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n## Tailwind 项目\n\n- Tailwind v4 的入口 CSS 第一行写 `@layer measure;`，再 `@import \"tailwindcss\";`，这样工具类会优先于 measure.css。\n\n- 中文标题不要用 `tracking-tight` 或 `tracking-tighter`。用 `tracking-normal`，或者不写。\n- 正文用 `leading-relaxed`（1.625）或 `leading-7`，不要用 `leading-tight` 或 `leading-snug`。\n- 正文容器可以用 `max-w-prose`（65ch）。1ch 是数字「0」的宽度，约为 0.5–0.6 个汉字宽，65ch 大约是 33–39 个汉字，在 28–40 字的范围内。\n- 构建后对产物运行校验：`node <measure-cjk 仓库>/packages/cli/bin/measure-cjk.js lint dist/`。\n\n## 检查清单\n\n1. `<html lang=\"zh-CN\">`\n2. 引入了 `measure.css`，或者自己写了等价的规则\n3. 字体栈里有中文字体；自托管的字体都是 🟢 档\n4. 正文行高 1.6–1.9，每行 28–40 字\n5. 中文没有斜体，没有负字距\n6. 全角标点，引号风格统一\n7. `measure-cjk lint` 零 error","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JFP7hZNjLYQsQ76AkWstXB"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8a85e9f-17fc-4fac-aeb7-bacb2c472a14","uuid":"c7917c7e-1e0e-45ef-8ffb-b5e522dd3a0d","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:33:41.292Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 1\ntotal 0\ndrwx------@     3 user  staff      96 Oct 26 11:33 .\ndrwx------@ 14634 user  staff  468288 Oct 26 11:33 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@     6 user  staff     192 Oct 26 11:33 measure-skill\nSKILL.md\nagents\nassets\nreferences\n\nmeasure-skill/agents:\nopenai.yaml\n\nmeasure-skill/assets:\ncards\nmeasure.css\n\nmeasure-skill/assets/cards:\ncover.html\nlist.html\nquote.html\n\nmeasure-skill/references:\nanti-patterns.md\nfonts.md\nscenarios\ntypesetting.md\n\nmeasure-skill/references/scenarios:\nweb.md\nxhs-card.md\n/* 分寸 · Measure 基础样式。全部放在 measure 层里：页面上任何不分层的样式，\n   以及后声明的层（例如 Tailwind v4 的 utilities），都会覆盖它。\n   要让 measure 成为第一个声明的层，请在入口 CSS 的第一行写：@layer measure; */\n@layer measure {\n  :where(:lang(zh)) {\n    line-break: strict;                    /* 广泛可用；写在每个中文元素上，中英混排页面也生效 */\n    font-synthesis-style: none;            /* 中文不出假斜体；西文真斜体不受影响 */\n    text-emphasis-position: under right;   /* 中文着重号在字下方 */\n  }\n\n  :where(:lang(zh)) :where(p