{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ9TJYnS3dL8Rc9JB559","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UhGzri7oprDKfwHFxo5nGq","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-015-2yWdHW/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>按量计费价格</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <header class=\"top\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">价格</p>\n      <h1>按调用次数计费，用多少付多少</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead measure-prose\">没有月费，没有最低消费。每个接口每月都有免费额度，超出部分按每千次调用计费，月底统一结算。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"free-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"free-title\">每月免费额度</h2>\n      <div class=\"free\">\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">18 万次</p>\n          <p>所有接口合计的免费调用次数，每月 1 日自动重置。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">¥0</p>\n          <p>免费额度内不收费，注册即可使用，无需绑定银行卡。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">按接口独立</p>\n          <p>各接口额度互不占用，某个接口用完不影响其他接口。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"price-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"price-title\">接口价格</h2>\n      <div class=\"table-box\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"col\">接口</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">端点</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\" class=\"price\">每月免费额度</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\" class=\"price\">超出后 / 每千次</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">文本生成</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单次输入不超过 4,000 字</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/text/generate</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">10,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥2.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">文本向量</span><span class=\"api-desc\">返回 1,024 维向量</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/embeddings</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">50,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.40</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">图片文字识别</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单张图片不超过 10 MB</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/vision/ocr</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">2,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥6.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">语音转写</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单段音频不超过 60 秒</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/audio/transcribe</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">1,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥8.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">内容审核</span><span class=\"api-desc\">文本与图片均可</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/moderation</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">20,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.80</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">地址解析</span><span class=\"api-desc\">地址与经纬度互查</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/geocode</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">97,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.20</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note measure-prose\">价格含税，以人民币计。调用失败（返回 5xx）不计费；参数错误（返回 4xx）照常计费。不足一千次的部分按实际次数折算，精确到分。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"tier-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"tier-title\">用量越大，单价越低</h2>\n      <div class=\"tiers\">\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>每月 100 万次以内</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">原价</p>\n          <p>按上表单价计费。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>100 万至 1,000 万次</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">9 折</p>\n          <p>超过 100 万次的部分自动打折。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>1,000 万次以上</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">8 折</p>\n          <p>超过 1,000 万次的部分自动打折。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>每月 1 亿次以上</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">另议</p>\n          <p>可签年度合同，享专属价格与服务保障。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note measure-prose\">阶梯按单个接口当月的计费次数（已扣除免费额度）累计，分段计算。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"calc-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"calc-title\">费用估算</h2>\n      <form class=\"calc\" id=\"calc\">\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"api\">接口</label>\n          <select id=\"api\"></select>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"calls\">每月调用次数</label>\n          <input id=\"calls\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1000\" value=\"500000\" inputmode=\"numeric\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n          <p class=\"detail\">预计每月费用</p>\n          <p class=\"total\" id=\"total\">¥0.00</p>\n          <p class=\"detail\" id=\"detail\"></p>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"faq-title\">常见问题</h2>\n      <div class=\"faq\">\n        <details>\n          <summary>免费额度用完后会自动扣费吗？</summary>\n          <p>只有在控制台开启了按量付费，超出部分才会计费；没有开启时，接口会返回 429，直到下月额度重置。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>没用完的免费额度能留到下个月吗？</summary>\n          <p>不能。免费额度每月 1 日重置，不累计、不折现。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>怎么查看用量和账单？</summary>\n          <p>控制台的「用量」页面按小时更新各接口的调用次数，账单在每月 3 日前生成，可以下载明细。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>可以设置消费上限吗？</summary>\n          <p>可以。在控制台为每个接口设置月度预算，达到上限后自动停止计费调用，并发送邮件提醒。</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      <p>价格自 2026 年 11 月 1 日起生效，如有调整将提前 30 天通知。</p>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    var APIS = [\n      { name: \"文本生成\", free: 10000, price: 2.0 },\n      { name: \"文本向量\", free: 50000, price: 0.4 },\n      { name: \"图片文字识别\", free: 2000, price: 6.0 },\n      { name: \"语音转写\", free: 1000, price: 8.0 },\n      { name: \"内容审核\", free: 20000, price: 0.8 },\n      { name: \"地址解析\", free: 97000, price: 0.2 }\n    ];\n    // 分段阶梯：[上限, 折扣]\n    var TIERS = [[1e6, 1], [1e7, 0.9], [Infinity, 0.8]];\n\n    var apiSel = document.getElementById(\"api\");\n    var callsIn = document.getElementById(\"calls\");\n    var totalEl = document.getElementById(\"total\");\n    var detailEl = document.getElementById(\"detail\");\n\n    APIS.forEach(function (a, i) {\n      var o = document.createElement(\"option\");\n      o.value = i;\n      o.textContent = a.name + \"（¥\" + a.price.toFixed(2) + \" / 千次）\";\n      apiSel.appendChild(o);\n    });\n\n    function fmt(n) { return n.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\"); }\n\n    function update() {\n      var a = APIS[apiSel.value];\n      var calls = Math.max(0, Math.floor(Number(callsIn.value) || 0));\n      var billable = Math.max(0, calls - a.free);\n      var cost = 0, prev = 0;\n      for (var i = 0; i < TIERS.length && billable > prev; i++) {\n        var seg = Math.min(billable, TIERS[i][0]) - prev;\n        cost += seg / 1000 * a.price * TIERS[i][1];\n        prev = TIERS[i][0];\n      }\n      totalEl.textContent = \"¥\" + cost.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\n      detailEl.textContent = billable === 0\n        ? \"全部在免费额度（\" + fmt(a.free) + \" 次）以内。\"\n        : \"扣除免费额度 \" + fmt(a.free) + \" 次后，计费 \" + fmt(billable) + \" 次。\";\n    }\n\n    apiSel.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\n    callsIn.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\n    document.getElementById(\"calc\").addEventListener(\"submit\", function (e) { e.preventDefault(); });\n    update();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2628,"cache_read_input_tokens":44582,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2628},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8a85e9f-17fc-4fac-aeb7-bacb2c472a14","uuid":"2210c28a-d7d4-48dd-85ad-9491c9a51b04","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:34:56.371Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ9THwJvaYX3wghSNU55","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01UhGzri7oprDKfwHFxo5nGq":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-015-2yWdHW/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>按量计费价格</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <header class=\"top\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">价格</p>\n      <h1>按调用次数计费，用多少付多少</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead measure-prose\">没有月费，没有最低消费。每个接口每月都有免费额度，超出部分按每千次调用计费，月底统一结算。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"free-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"free-title\">每月免费额度</h2>\n      <div class=\"free\">\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">18 万次</p>\n          <p>所有接口合计的免费调用次数，每月 1 日自动重置。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">¥0</p>\n          <p>免费额度内不收费，注册即可使用，无需绑定银行卡。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">按接口独立</p>\n          <p>各接口额度互不占用，某个接口用完不影响其他接口。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"price-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"price-title\">接口价格</h2>\n      <div class=\"table-box\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"col\">接口</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">端点</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\" class=\"price\">每月免费额度</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\" class=\"price\">超出后 / 每千次</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">文本生成</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单次输入不超过 4,000 字</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/text/generate</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">10,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥2.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">文本向量</span><span class=\"api-desc\">返回 1,024 维向量</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/embeddings</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">50,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.40</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">图片文字识别</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单张图片不超过 10 MB</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/vision/ocr</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">2,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥6.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">语音转写</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单段音频不超过 60 秒</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/audio/transcribe</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">1,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥8.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">内容审核</span><span class=\"api-desc\">文本与图片均可</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/moderation</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">20,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.80</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">地址解析</span><span class=\"api-desc\">地址与经纬度互查</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/geocode</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">97,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.20</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note measure-prose\">价格含税，以人民币计。调用失败（返回 5xx）不计费；参数错误（返回 4xx）照常计费。不足一千次的部分按实际次数折算，精确到分。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"tier-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"tier-title\">用量越大，单价越低</h2>\n      <div class=\"tiers\">\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>每月 100 万次以内</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">原价</p>\n          <p>按上表单价计费。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>100 万至 1,000 万次</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">9 折</p>\n          <p>超过 100 万次的部分自动打折。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>1,000 万次以上</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">8 折</p>\n          <p>超过 1,000 万次的部分自动打折。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>每月 1 亿次以上</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">另议</p>\n          <p>可签年度合同，享专属价格与服务保障。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note measure-prose\">阶梯按单个接口当月的计费次数（已扣除免费额度）累计，分段计算。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"calc-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"calc-title\">费用估算</h2>\n      <form class=\"calc\" id=\"calc\">\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"api\">接口</label>\n          <select id=\"api\"></select>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"calls\">每月调用次数</label>\n          <input id=\"calls\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1000\" value=\"500000\" inputmode=\"numeric\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n          <p class=\"detail\">预计每月费用</p>\n          <p class=\"total\" id=\"total\">¥0.00</p>\n          <p class=\"detail\" id=\"detail\"></p>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"faq-title\">常见问题</h2>\n      <div class=\"faq\">\n        <details>\n          <summary>免费额度用完后会自动扣费吗？</summary>\n          <p>只有在控制台开启了按量付费，超出部分才会计费；没有开启时，接口会返回 429，直到下月额度重置。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>没用完的免费额度能留到下个月吗？</summary>\n          <p>不能。免费额度每月 1 日重置，不累计、不折现。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>怎么查看用量和账单？</summary>\n          <p>控制台的「用量」页面按小时更新各接口的调用次数，账单在每月 3 日前生成，可以下载明细。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>可以设置消费上限吗？</summary>\n          <p>可以。在控制台为每个接口设置月度预算，达到上限后自动停止计费调用，并发送邮件提醒。</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      <p>价格自 2026 年 11 月 1 日起生效，如有调整将提前 30 天通知。</p>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    var APIS = [\n      { name: \"文本生成\", free: 10000, price: 2.0 },\n      { name: \"文本向量\", free: 50000, price: 0.4 },\n      { name: \"图片文字识别\", free: 2000, price: 6.0 },\n      { name: \"语音转写\", free: 1000, price: 8.0 },\n      { name: \"内容审核\", free: 20000, price: 0.8 },\n      { name: \"地址解析\", free: 97000, price: 0.2 }\n    ];\n    // 分段阶梯：[上限, 折扣]\n    var TIERS = [[1e6, 1], [1e7, 0.9], [Infinity, 0.8]];\n\n    var apiSel = document.getElementById(\"api\");\n    var callsIn = document.getElementById(\"calls\");\n    var totalEl = document.getElementById(\"total\");\n    var detailEl = document.getElementById(\"detail\");\n\n    APIS.forEach(function (a, i) {\n      var o = document.createElement(\"option\");\n      o.value = i;\n      o.textContent = a.name + \"（¥\" + a.price.toFixed(2) + \" / 千次）\";\n      apiSel.appendChild(o);\n    });\n\n    function fmt(n) { return n.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\"); }\n\n    function update() {\n      var a = APIS[apiSel.value];\n      var calls = Math.max(0, Math.floor(Number(callsIn.value) || 0));\n      var billable = Math.max(0, calls - a.free);\n      var cost = 0, prev = 0;\n      for (var i = 0; i < TIERS.length && billable > prev; i++) {\n        var seg = Math.min(billable, TIERS[i][0]) - prev;\n        cost += seg / 1000 * a.price * TIERS[i][1];\n        prev = TIERS[i][0];\n      }\n      totalEl.textContent = \"¥\" + cost.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\n      detailEl.textContent = billable === 0\n        ? \"全部在免费额度（\" + fmt(a.free) + \" 次）以内。\"\n        : \"扣除免费额度 \" + fmt(a.free) + \" 次后，计费 \" + fmt(billable) + \" 次。\";\n    }\n\n    apiSel.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\n    callsIn.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\n    document.getElementById(\"calc\").addEventListener(\"submit\", function (e) { e.preventDefault(); });\n    update();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UhGzri7oprDKfwHFxo5nGq","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-015-2yWdHW/index.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8a85e9f-17fc-4fac-aeb7-bacb2c472a14","uuid":"cb4ef4de-ecc0-4188-a2e3-fa1f311ab4c6","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:34:56.377Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-015-2yWdHW/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>按量计费价格</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <header class=\"top\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">价格</p>\n      <h1>按调用次数计费，用多少付多少</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead measure-prose\">没有月费，没有最低消费。每个接口每月都有免费额度，超出部分按每千次调用计费，月底统一结算。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"free-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"free-title\">每月免费额度</h2>\n      <div class=\"free\">\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">18 万次</p>\n          <p>所有接口合计的免费调用次数，每月 1 日自动重置。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">¥0</p>\n          <p>免费额度内不收费，注册即可使用，无需绑定银行卡。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"free-card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">按接口独立</p>\n          <p>各接口额度互不占用，某个接口用完不影响其他接口。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"price-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"price-title\">接口价格</h2>\n      <div class=\"table-box\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"col\">接口</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">端点</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\" class=\"price\">每月免费额度</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\" class=\"price\">超出后 / 每千次</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">文本生成</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单次输入不超过 4,000 字</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/text/generate</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">10,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥2.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">文本向量</span><span class=\"api-desc\">返回 1,024 维向量</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/embeddings</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">50,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.40</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">图片文字识别</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单张图片不超过 10 MB</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/vision/ocr</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">2,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥6.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">语音转写</span><span class=\"api-desc\">单段音频不超过 60 秒</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/audio/transcribe</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">1,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥8.00</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">内容审核</span><span class=\"api-desc\">文本与图片均可</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/moderation</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">20,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.80</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><span class=\"api-name\">地址解析</span><span class=\"api-desc\">地址与经纬度互查</span></td>\n              <td><code>/v1/geocode</code></td>\n              <td class=\"price\">97,000 次</td>\n              <td class=\"price\"><strong>¥0.20</strong></td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note measure-prose\">价格含税，以人民币计。调用失败（返回 5xx）不计费；参数错误（返回 4xx）照常计费。不足一千次的部分按实际次数折算，精确到分。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"tier-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"tier-title\">用量越大，单价越低</h2>\n      <div class=\"tiers\">\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>每月 100 万次以内</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">原价</p>\n          <p>按上表单价计费。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>100 万至 1,000 万次</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">9 折</p>\n          <p>超过 100 万次的部分自动打折。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>1,000 万次以上</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">8 折</p>\n          <p>超过 1,000 万次的部分自动打折。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tier\">\n          <h3>每月 1 亿次以上</h3>\n          <p class=\"off\">另议</p>\n          <p>可签年度合同，享专属价格与服务保障。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"note measure-prose\">阶梯按单个接口当月的计费次数（已扣除免费额度）累计，分段计算。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"calc-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"calc-title\">费用估算</h2>\n      <form class=\"calc\" id=\"calc\">\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"api\">接口</label>\n          <select id=\"api\"></select>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label for=\"calls\">每月调用次数</label>\n          <input id=\"calls\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1000\" value=\"500000\" inputmode=\"numeric\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n          <p class=\"detail\">预计每月费用</p>\n          <p class=\"total\" id=\"total\">¥0.00</p>\n          <p class=\"detail\" id=\"detail\"></p>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"faq-title\">常见问题</h2>\n      <div class=\"faq\">\n        <details>\n          <summary>免费额度用完后会自动扣费吗？</summary>\n          <p>只有在控制台开启了按量付费，超出部分才会计费；没有开启时，接口会返回 429，直到下月额度重置。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>没用完的免费额度能留到下个月吗？</summary>\n          <p>不能。免费额度每月 1 日重置，不累计、不折现。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>怎么查看用量和账单？</summary>\n          <p>控制台的「用量」页面按小时更新各接口的调用次数，账单在每月 3 日前生成，可以下载明细。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>可以设置消费上限吗？</summary>\n          <p>可以。在控制台为每个接口设置月度预算，达到上限后自动停止计费调用，并发送邮件提醒。</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      <p>价格自 2026 年 11 月 1 日起生效，如有调整将提前 30 天通知。</p>\n    </footer>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    var APIS = [\n      { name: \"文本生成\", free: 10000, price: 2.0 },\n      { name: \"文本向量\", free: 50000, price: 0.4 },\n      { name: \"图片文字识别\", free: 2000, price: 6.0 },\n      { name: \"语音转写\", free: 1000, price: 8.0 },\n      { name: \"内容审核\", free: 20000, price: 0.8 },\n      { name: \"地址解析\", free: 97000, price: 0.2 }\n    ];\n    // 分段阶梯：[上限, 折扣]\n    var TIERS = [[1e6, 1], [1e7, 0.9], [Infinity, 0.8]];\n\n    var apiSel = document.getElementById(\"api\");\n    var callsIn = document.getElementById(\"calls\");\n    var totalEl = document.getElementById(\"total\");\n    var detailEl = document.getElementById(\"detail\");\n\n    APIS.forEach(function (a, i) {\n      var o = document.createElement(\"option\");\n      o.value = i;\n      o.textContent = a.name + \"（¥\" + a.price.toFixed(2) + \" / 千次）\";\n      apiSel.appendChild(o);\n    });\n\n    function fmt(n) { return n.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\"); }\n\n    function update() {\n      var a = APIS[apiSel.value];\n      var calls = Math.max(0, Math.floor(Number(callsIn.value) || 0));\n      var billable = Math.max(0, calls - a.free);\n      var cost = 0, prev = 0;\n      for (var i = 0; i < TIERS.length && billable > prev; i++) {\n        var seg = Math.min(billable, TIERS[i][0]) - prev;\n        cost += seg / 1000 * a.price * TIERS[i][1];\n        prev = TIERS[i][0];\n      }\n      totalEl.textContent = \"¥\" + cost.toLocaleString(\"zh-CN\", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\n      detailEl.textContent = billable === 0\n        ? \"全部在免费额度（\" + fmt(a.free) + \" 次）以内。\"\n        : \"扣除免费额度 \" + fmt(a.free) + \" 次后，计费 \" + fmt(billable) + \" 次。\";\n    }\n\n    apiSel.addEventListener(\"change\", update);\n    callsIn.addEventListener(\"input\", update);\n    document.getElementById(\"calc\").addEventListener(\"submit\", function (e) { e.preventDefault(); });\n    update();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UhGzri7oprDKfwHFxo5nGq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
